<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1500s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 16th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1500s, 1,280 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 377 were founded and 298 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Ottoman Empire, the Spanish Empire and the Crown of Castile.</p></header>
